flowchart TD
  Start([Customer requests return]) --> Select[Select items to return<br/>partial return allowed: keep the rest]
  Select --> Reason[Choose reason]
  Reason --> Submit[Submit return request]
  Submit --> Approve{Approved by staff?}
  Approve -- No --> Reject[Reject & notify customer] --> End1([End])
  Approve -- Yes --> Collect[Agent collects returned item]
  Collect --> Inspect{Inspect condition}
  Inspect -- Sellable --> Restock[Restock to a batch/location<br/>stock_movement = RETURN in]
  Inspect -- Opened --> Quarantine[Move to quarantine/open-box<br/>not auto-sellable]
  Inspect -- Damaged --> Damage[Move to damaged/write-off<br/>no restock]
  Restock --> Settle
  Quarantine --> Settle
  Damage --> Settle
  Settle[Settle: refund / exchange / points adjust] --> Ledger[Update order, returns, audit log]
  Ledger --> Notify[Notify customer of outcome]
  Notify --> End2([End])
